  <div itemscope="" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <p class="icon-card__description" itemprop="text">Rinse currently serves the following major metro areas for professional laundry and dry cleaning services: <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-san-francisco/">San Francisco</a>, <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-new-york/">New York</a>, <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-los-angeles/">Los Angeles</a>, <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-washington-dc/">Washington DC</a>, <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-chicago/">Chicago</a>, <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-boston/">Boston</a>, <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-austin/">Austin</a>, <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-dallas/">Dallas</a>, <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-new-jersey/">New Jersey</a>, <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-seattle/">Seattle</a>, and <a href="/dry-cleaning-laundry-service-toronto/">Toronto</a>. Enjoy convenient laundry pickup and delivery across these key locations.</p>
  </div>
</div>

        
      </div>
    
